(ELECTRICITY SUPPLY AND DISTRIBUTION \(STANDARDS OF PERFORMANCE\) REGULATIONS, 2008) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Voltage levels) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. \(1\) Subject to regulation 21\(1\), a supplier shall ensure that the) Tj T*
(voltage at the point of supply to a customer's premises or electrical installation is within) Tj T*
(plus or minus ten percent of the following voltage levels: \(a\) 230 Volts; \(b\) 400 Volts;) Tj T*
(\(c\) 11 Kilovolts; \(d\) 33 Kilovolts; or \(e\) 34.5 Kilovolts.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
